<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Friday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's est 100,000, Wk ago 108,000, Yr ago 101,000. Saturday's 20,000, 34,000, and 25,000. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts were $0.50 to mostly $1.00 higher than mid-session Thursday. Trade was slow to moderate for good demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $57.50 per cwt.</p>
